{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_027_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6d1b2806ef439e312643deea88602af8c4779962effb1eb13e6d4af72a3e7a92",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04fc0e1a8b6a27bc1dd58318fcf1aa1dda5b7cbbdbbbc7640fca95f201724136",
      "text": "哎呀？这难道是……\n情人节的巧克力吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1728daffa3f954b4d8e7e374d52f9268da6eb37fe5dd618aac62a412efd25e0a",
      "text": "没想到居然能从●●●●プロデューサー那里\n收到呢，真让人开心啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:532c94d4c473664f8f2874a15e58b2bcc52e7d2402894033064f27de84e1281f",
      "text": "我得赶紧去挑选能把这款巧克力的美味\n发挥到极致的红茶了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:946444c541be242536281f9bd3107476a80d5c7be777339e309028b5fc211185",
      "text": "感想下次再向制作人汇报吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec12da718f1212e0c4e73fffb5a9ceae045a42557ad0ceaccdd6ecfb464c80c6",
      "text": "白色情人节也请好好期待着哦。\n我会准备好倾注心意的回礼的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b16ae864a951027e9883344e1aaa311a6c7c47c8b8e195ec1c36a1af34d268c9",
      "text": "谢谢你的情人节巧克力，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9884a5bff33215d2f5403f89b771f56bc93cb1b549c45c451586b5df09a0915a",
      "text": "真让人高兴呢。没想到你会给我准备这么棒的\n惊喜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96e227d16d48c81933f3bec4e6a6cb3fb9752604a8ae9a3a19dd2f06d329883e",
      "text": "……那么，该配什么样的红茶\n才适合这款巧克力呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bfdc84fe8a17e89575982a2fc153aa434e74d68f4ba9289afb9d21729b1b4f9",
      "text": "考虑到红茶的采摘季与品质，\n顶峰季节的汀布拉锡兰红茶大概最合适吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:124b8d302a9618e2bf120866661a16e7661c953cd4c6c8d0bf4347605238fa39",
      "text": "所谓汀布拉，是一种以散发着玫瑰香气为特征的\n红茶哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_b:cmd-000038:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ede79c62321eec27be5a0a7cd7833431a0ed0969a02ae4c2a4111065d1e6df4b",
      "text": "感觉会是绝配呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_b:cmd-000039:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65266ab67120ab6eb0e3c25149361354822ff63629ab6742344c736678baf2d5",
      "text": "居然还有这种红茶啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:341bbd23a95cb59ab592a7afed94011673a8292a1e5e94f78ceb9b7f36892ef0",
      "text": "嗯。是非常好喝的红茶哦。\n下次请你尝尝吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:341bbd23a95cb59ab592a7afed94011673a8292a1e5e94f78ceb9b7f36892ef0",
      "text": "嗯。是非常好喝的红茶哦。\n下次请你尝尝吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55a21e676580340ec19256b2176f7f8859f68642c294888deb9372ac89cfd15d",
      "text": "话虽如此……呵呵。把制作人送的巧克力\n当成茶点，还真是有够奢侈的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6434b50cf6f65039887ba6f42480655c2a3378810bf4ec75b580cf8394c0709",
      "text": "从现在起就期待着享用了。\n真的很谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_027_22:5_01_027_22_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a6480eeb59b3977975600fe12f87a3c286badf3994770f4c7379b803e837390",
      "text": "希望你能期待白色情人节的回礼哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
